Findings:
${JSON.stringify(stillConfirmed.map(({ risk_notes, avg_confidence, ...f }) => ({ ...f, risk_notes })), null, 2)}

For each cluster: cluster_id, short name, member finding ids, why they must be grouped (shared lines / shared data flow / conflicting edits), and any cross-cluster dependency (cluster X's fix must land before/after cluster Y's because of Z). Also note fully independent findings that can be their own single-member cluster.

Output clusters array and a dependency_notes array (cluster_id pairs with the reason one must precede the other, if any).`,
