465	      </div>
466	      <p style="margin-top:16px;">One cluster left: <b>docs</b> — the npm platform/main split and <code>dependencyFailed</code> semantics need a section in <code>docs/06-publishing.md</code>. Deliberately last, since it documents behavior #31 is still settling.</p>
467	    </section>
