304	    <section id="pipeline">
305	      <div class="section-head"><span class="section-num">03</span><h2>The release pipeline</h2></div>
306	      <p class="lede">Four CLI commands, orchestrated by <code>callisto-action</code> (a GitHub composite action) as separate process invocations — no shared state except the JSON each one prints.</p>
307	
308	      <div class="diagram">
309	        <pre class="mermaid">
310	%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor':'#e4eeed','primaryTextColor':'#163336','primaryBorderColor':'#2b5d62','lineColor':'#8a9092','fontFamily':'IBM Plex Sans','fontSize':'13px','actorBkg':'#ffffff','actorBorder':'#2b5d62','actorTextColor':'#163336','signalColor':'#565d5f','signalTextColor':'#1c1e1e','noteBkgColor':'#e4eeed','noteBorderColor':'#2b5d62'}}}%%
